\{Slightly Foxed\}\par
\par
I saw your \{camden\} skirt-\par
swirl as you \{turned\}-\par
for more books from-\par
your \{rolling cart\}.\par
\par
One night you'd \{smiled\}-\par
and said you'd \{learned\}-\par
that reshelving done-\par
you'd touched every \{book\}-\par
\par
in the \{building\}.\par
A quiet \{pride\} burned-\par
at order \{spun\}-\par
open to \{all\}.\par
\par
\{Patrick Barry\}
